# L2a on the rung span in closed form

At the optimal `s = √(τ₂/(2(1 + ρ₁)))` the `(1, 2)` pair of Cvs.L2a.FirstSecondPairNoGram is paid by `2Λ(2) √((1 + ρ₁) τ₂/2)`, so L2a on the
prolate rung span holds, uniformly in `b`, with the prime constant `Σ_{k ≤ b} 2Λ(k) τ_k/k + 2Λ(2) √((1 + ρ₁) τ₂/2) + ρ`
in the tail fractions `τ_k`, the rest `ρ₁` of the `k = 1` pairs and the rest `ρ` of the prime-power pairs.
-/

