    hh' hh₂ hh₂' hη0 hη' hb hbM hε hε2 hδ hμ₁ hμ₂ hMpos hN₀ hD hgap hξ₀ hξ₀b hw hden hκ hx hKf hfl hB hβ hβ0 hτ h2
    hs₂ hρ₁ hτ₂.le hrest1 hrest hpole
